    "chunk_text": "...................... Date: - Medical Officer of Health -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSecond Schedule\n\nPhotograph\n\nMedical Certificate issued to the Mobile Traders of Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area\n\n....................... ............................ Date Medical Officer of Health (Official Seal)\n\n12-691/14\n\n90 A IV(\u0d85) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019\n\nYATIYANTHOTA PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nBy- Law regarding Maintenance of Retail Shops\n\nTHIS is to notify that I, Dhamma Dissanayake, Governor of the Sabaragamuwa Province has approved the By-law regarding maintenance of Retail Shops within authoritative area of Yatiyanthota Pradeshiya Sabha, prepared by the Yatiyanthota Pradeshiya Sabha by virtue of powers vested in it under Section 122 read with Section 126 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of 1987 and passed at its General meeting held on 09.07.2019, by virtue of powers vested under Section 123(1) of Pradeshiya Sabha Act, read with Section 2 of Provincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989, and it will be effective within authoritative area of Yatiyanthota Pradeshiya Sabha from the date this notification is published in the Gazette. DHAMMA DISSANAYAKE, Governor, Sabaragamuwa Province. At the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council, On this 30th day of October, 2019.\n\nBy-Law on the Maintenance of Retail Shops within Yatiyanthota Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area\n\n1. This By-Law is enacted to regulate, administer and control the retail shops in the area of the Yatiyanthota Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n2. This by-law is known as the By-Law on the Maintenance of Retail Shops within Yatiyanthota Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area"
