bulbakmeegahamulahena; Land Use: Paddy field; Claimant: State; Original claimant: A.R.M. Ferose; Extent: Hectare 0.0014\n\n5. Lot No. 05 Name of the land: Palkadapurankumbura; Land Use: Paddy field; Claimant: State; Original claimant: K.A.U. Kumara; Extent: Hectare 0.0103\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nPG 4814 - 192 (2019/12)"
