    "chunk_text": "(iii) Thrice the number of vacancies from among those who obtained the minimum marksand above required to pass the written examination will be called for the general interview.The general interview will be conducted by a Board of Interview appointed by the PublicService Commission.\n\n(iv) Only the candidates who completed the basic qualifications from among those who sitfor the general interview will be called for the interview for evaluating eligibility andthe practical test.\n\nSection No.Proposed Amendment\n\n20\n\n7.3.2.1(v)\n\nRemark01includedunder 7.3.2.1\n\n7.3.4\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'09PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 09.12.20194A\n\nWill be amended as\n\n(a) Marks will not be awarded.\n\nWill be amended the topic as\n\n\u201cInterview for Evaluating Eligibility and Practical Test\u201d\n\nPromotion to Grade II from Grade III\n\nQualifications to be fulfilled:Will be amended as\n\n\u201c (viii) Should have successfully completed the Capacity Building Course 01 (Schedule XI)\u201d\n\n(c) A Post Graduate Degree in Education in case of officers in respect of whom a PostGraduate Degree in the relevant area of subject was a basic qualification when recruitedto the Sri Lanka Teacher Educators Service.\n\nAll contents included under this Section will be removed and following will be incorporated.\n\nPromotion to Grade II from Grade III during the interim period.\n\n(a) Remark 02 of Section 8 is applicable\n\n(b) Selections (II) and (III) of 10.1.1 are amended as follows for the officers who havecompleted the qualifications in Section 14(a) of the Service Minute No.1070/13 of11.03.1990 and they will be promoted as from the date they complete other qualificationsexcluding the one referred to in 10.1.1 (VIII)."
