    "chunk_text": "(b) Selections (II) and (III) of 10.1.1 are amended as follows for the officers who havecompleted the qualifications in Section 14(a) of the Service Minute No.1070/13 of11.03.1990 and they will be promoted as from the date they complete other qualificationsexcluding the one referred to in 10.1.1 (VIII).\n\n* Should have demonstrated a performance at satisfactory level or above duringseven (07) years immediately preceding the date of promotion in accordancewith the approved procedure of performance appraisal.\n\n(c) In terms of Section 17 of the Service Minute No. 1070/13 of 11.03.1990, the officerswho have not fulfilled the requirement of passing the English Language and have beenrecruited to the Sri Lanka Teacher Educators Service before 01.01.2002 shouldcomplete a Course in English Language of a duration not less than two weeks from aninstitution decided by the Secretary of the Ministry of Education. Officers who havepassed the subject of English in the General Certificate of Education (Ordinary Level)will be reckoned as officers having fulfilled this qualification.\n\nSection No.Proposed Amendment\n\n(a) of 7.3.4.3\n\n7.3.4.4\n\n10.1\n\n10.1.1\n\n(c)of 10.2.1(i)\n\n15.1\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'09PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 09.12.20195A\n\nContents referred to under the amendments published by the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2141/73 dated 19.09.2019 will be removed and the contents stated in the approved Service Minutepublished in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1925/37 dated 28.07.2015 are applicable to thisSection.\n\nWill be amended as \u201c Communication skills\u201d\n\nSection No.Proposed Amendment\n\n15.2\n\nSchedule \u2013III1.4 EnglishLanguage\n\n12 - 802\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
