    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2153/13 - 2019 \u0dd9\u0daf\u0dc3\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 12 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.12.12\n\nNo. 2153/13 \u2013 THURSDAY, DECEMBER 12, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 31635 - 17 (2019/12)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref No: DS/GFG/L&L/05/133 Ministry of Lands & Land Development Ref No:\n\n4-3/16/2018/UD/457 I hereby give notice, under Sub-section(1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No.28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the land described below for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land to be acquired: The allotments of land in total extent of 0.0029 hectare depicted in sheet No. 30 of Block No. 02 of Cadastral Map No. 810024 as lot Nos. 1077,1078 prepared by Survey General situated in village of Deddugoda in Grama Niladhari Division No. 101 A, Deddugoda South, within Municipal Council limit of Galle in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Four Gravets Galle in District of Galle , Southern Province. The names and extents of above named lots are as follows :\n\n1. Lot No. : 1077 Name of the land : Mahamoragodawaththa,; assessment number - not known; Description: Home\n\ngarden, a part of a boundary wall ; Claimant : State; Original Claimant : D.P.Y. Gamage; Extent : about 0.0015 hectare.\n\n2. Lot No.: 1078 Name of the land : Mahamoragodawaththa, assessment number \u2013 118/4, Hirimbura cross road; Description: Home garden, a part of a boundary wall; Claimant : State; Original Claimant : Batapola Gamage Udaya Kasun; Extent : about 0.0014 hectare."
