    "chunk_text": "2. Lot No.: 1078 Name of the land : Mahamoragodawaththa, assessment number \u2013 118/4, Hirimbura cross road; Description: Home garden, a part of a boundary wall; Claimant : State; Original Claimant : Batapola Gamage Udaya Kasun; Extent : about 0.0014 hectare.\n\n12 - 889/1\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.12 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.12.2019\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref No: DS/GFG/L&L/05/133 Ministry of Lands & Land Development Ref No:\n\n4-3/16/2018/UD/457 I hereby give notice, under Sub-section(1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No.28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the land described below for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land to be acquired: The allotments of land in total extent of 0.0083 hectare depicted in sheet No. 06 of Block No. 01 of Cadastral Map No. 810025 as lot Nos. 422,423,425 & 427 prepared by the Survey General situated in village of Dangedara in Grama Niladhari Division No. 97D, Dangedara East, within Municipal Council limit of Galle in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Four Gravets Galle in District of Galle , Southern Province. The names and extents of above named lots are as follows -\n\n01. Lot No. : 422 Name of the land : Kurunduwaththapashawulaovita, Pashawulaovita alias Kurunduwaththaaddara Mahaliyadda and Kukalaneovita; Description: Home garden and mix cultivation; Claimant : State; Original Claimant: Sajith Dayarathna; Extent : about 0.0040 hectare\n\n02. Lot No. : 423 Name of the land : Kurunduwaththapashawulaovita, Pashawulaovita alias Kurunduwaththaaddara Mahaliyadda and Kukalaneovita; Description : Home garden and Part of\n\na permanent building; Claimant : State; Original Claimant : Hewa Marambage Dharmasena; Extent : about 0.0013 hectare"
