    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'12PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA -12.12.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2153$15 - 2019 foie\u00efn\u00be ui 12 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'12'12No. 2153/15 - THURSDAY, DECEMBER 12, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A G 31637 \u2014 22 (12/2019)\n\nPILGRIMAGES ORDINANCE\n\nREGULATIONS made by the Minister of Internal & Home Affairs and Provincial Councils & Local Government in termsof Section 2 of Pilgrimages Ordinance (Chapter 175)\n\nJANAKA BANDARA TENNAKOON,Minister of Public Administration,Home Affairs and Provincial Councils &Local Government.\n\nMinistry of Public Administration & Home Affairs and Provincial Councils & Local Government,Nila Medura,Elvitigala Mawatha,Narahenpita, Colombo 05,02nd December, 2019,\n\nRegulations\n\n1.These regulations may be cited as the regulation of Sankapala Raja Maha Viharaya, in the Grama Niladhari\u2019sDivision of No. 224/F, Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Ambilipitiya in Ratnapura District.\n\n2.In these regulations\n\n\u201cCamp area\u201d means the area described in the schedule.\u201cDistrict Secretary/ Government Agent\u201d means the Government Agent of Rathnapura Administrative District and it also includes any officer authorized by him in terms of regulation 4.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'12PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA -12.12.20192A"
