    "chunk_text": "26.No person shall donate or distribute anything for charity either by cash or by any other means within the camparea except in a place reserved or provided for begging and solicitation for charity under regulation 7.\n\n28.No person shall unduly alter or remove any notice or name board displayed in any place under regulation7 or 10.\n\n29.It shall be lawful for the District Secretary/Governnent Agent, Medical Officer, Public Health Inspector orany Police Officer to,\n\n(a)Enter any land or place within the camp area for the purpose of carrying out any regulation from amongthese regulations and,\n\n(b)To construct or erect a post in any land or place within the camp area for the purpose of displaying anotice or a name board under regulation 7.\n\n30.It shall be lawful for the District Secretary/Government Agent to cancel the following at any time if heconsiders that the cancellation is appropriate or it is for the benefit in the public interest.\n\n(a)Any permission given under regulation 6 or regulation 27.\n\n(b)Permit issued under regulation 9.\n\n(c)Any license issued under regulation 15.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nThe margins of the land which belongs to Sankapala Raja Maha Viharaya which is situated in the GramaNiladhari\u2019s Division of No. 224/F Sankapala, Ambilipitiya Divisional Secretariat of Ratnapura District are indicated asfollows :\n\nNorth-Mount of Sankapala ;\n\nSouth-The Rakwana River ;\n\nEast-Perehara Road ;\n\nWest-Perehara Road.\n\n06 - 891\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
