d Plantation; Claimant: State; Original claimant: P. W. Ariyapala; Extent: 0.0113 Hectare.\n\nLot No. 04 Name of the land: Aluthwatta alias Ambagahamula-hena; Land Use: Garden; Claimant: State; Original claimant: Not known; Extent: 0.0205 Hectare."
