    "chunk_text": "Name of the land: Mahaovita, assessment number 500 A, Hirimbura Road; Description: Home garden; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Jayantha Kariyawasam; Extent: about 0.0008 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/ servitude on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nwriting, before me at Divisional Secretariat \u2013 Galle Four Gravets on 06.01.2019 at 9.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 23.12.2019, nature of their interests in the land/ lands, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nHIMALI RATHNAWEERA, Divisional Secretary, Galle Four Gravets. At Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office, Galle- Four Gravets, 13th December, 2019. 1-07"
