    "chunk_text": "All persons who entitled or claim ownership for theaforesaid land are required to appear personally or by agent\n\nIII fldgi - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'16PART III - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 16.12.20192A\n\nFurther hereby requested to notify in writing (in duplicate)on or before ..................... 2019, that the nature of the ownership,reason of the claim compensation for the acquisition of saidland, the amount of compensation and the details of thecomputation of such amount. It should be informed theownership by a letter to prove the ownership. And also thedeeds and other documents should be provided on the dateof inspection.\n\nY. I. M. SILVA,Divisional Secretary,\n\nMeerigama.\n\nAt Divisional Secretariat,Meerigama,14th October, 2019.\n\n1 - 10\n\n\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Reference No. : POL/MDG/L/MKP/104/2.\n\nLand Ministry's Reference No. : 4/3/9/2010/TR/289.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act that the Government intends to acquirethe lands shown below which are required for the constructionof the Kauduluwewa Medirigiriya Sub Main Canal under theMoragahakanda Kaluganga Development Project.\n\nDescription of the Lands to be Acquired:\n\nThe allotments of land described below as shown in F.T.P.11Inset No. 662 Sheet No. 698 located in the No. 104Ekamuthugama Grama Niladahris' Division in the SinhalaPattuwa Minor Division in the Medirigiriya DivisionalSecretary's Division in the District of Polonnaruwa in the NorthCentral Province:"
