    "chunk_text": "3. Lot No. 03Name of the Land: Rajagiriya Kumbura, Obesekarapurawatta, Assmt. No. B/151/1 of Arunodaya Mawatha andothers; Description: Garden, permanent two storied building,12 permanent buildings, 20 temporary buildings, parts of 2permanent buildings and parts of 2 temporary buildings;Claimant: Commission of Land Reforms; Extent: 0.1363 Hectare.\n\nIII fldgi - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'17PART III - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 17.12.20192A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\npermanent buildings; Claimant: Commission of Land Reforms;Extent: 0.4180 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid lands are herebyrequired to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized inwriting, before me at the Divisional Secretariat of SriJayawardenapura Kotte on the 30th December 2019 at 10.00a.m and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (withduplicates) before 20 December 2019, the nature of the interestin the land, the particular of their claim for compensation forthe acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensationand the details of the computation of such amount. All deeds\n\nand other documents which are assist to claim should beforwarded in the inquiry.\n\nW. L. R. I. LIYANAGE,Divisional Secretary, Sri Jayawardenapura Kotte.\n\nDivisional Secretariat at Sri Jayawardenapura Kotte,12th December, 2019.\n\n01-111"
