    "chunk_text": "01. Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Puliyady: Description: Garden, contains one permanent building, one pit and tube well; Name of the Claimant: Selvarasa Ajith Kumar; Extent: 0.0180 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Tellippalai on the 10th day of February, 2020 at 10.00 a. m. and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 31st day of January, 2020 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nS. SIVASRI, Divisional Secretary, Tellipalai. Divisional Secretariat, Valikamam North, Tellipapai. 09th December, 2019. 12-892\n\nG 31638 - 22 (2019/12)\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2154/9 - 2019 \u0dd9\u0daf\u0dc3\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 18 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.12.18\n\nNo. 2154/9 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 18, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: DS/VN/L.A.A/MSJ-232. Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms Ref. No.:\n\n4-3/5/2018/HA/04.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following servitude which is required for a public