    "chunk_text": "01. Lot No. 25Cadastral Plan No: C.M. 320229 (6)3; Date of inquiries ofcompensation: 30.01.2020; Time: 10.00 a.m; Place: DivisionalSecretariat, Udapalatha, Gampola.\n\n02. Lot No. 26Cadastral Plan No: C.M. 320229 (6)3; Date of inquiries ofcompensation: 30.01.2020; Time: 10.00 a.m; Place: DivisionalSecretariat, Udapalatha, Gampola.\n\nIII fldgi - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'18PART III - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 18.12.20192A\n\nnotify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 16th dayof January 2020 the nature of their interests in the land , theparticulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisitionof the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation andthe details of the computation of such amount.\n\nR.A.D.T.N. THENNAKOON,\n\nDivisional Secretary,Udapalatha Division,\n\nGampola.\n\nDivisional Secretariat,Udapalatha,12th December, 2019.\n\n01-129\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Reference No. : J/DS/2/9/4/2-2017.Land Ministry's Ref. No.: 4-3/15/2017/VE/205.\n\nI hereby give notice, Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the LandAcquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitude which is required for apublic purpose.\n\nDescription of the land or servitude to be acquired :\n\nPreliminary Plan No. PPYA 2948; Village: Columbuthurai(Ward No.08, within the Municipal Council limits of Jaffna);\n\nG.N. Division: J/61, Nedunkulam; D.S. Division : Jaffna, District:Jaffna; Province: Northern Province; Purpose: For VillageExpansion Scheme.\n\n01. Lot No. 1Name of land: Columbuthurai Thennamthoddam Assmt.No.551 (Part) Columbuthurai Road; Land Use: Garden containsa masonry well; Owner: Kumutha Vivekananthan andKalaimagal Lingeswaran;Extent: 1.0117 Hectare."
