    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPART III - LANDS\n\nTitle Registration\n\nREGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998\n\nDeclaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby de-clare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land No. 119 of Block 03, con-tained in the Cadastral Map No. 410111, situated in the Village of Puttalam within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 617 B - Putta-lam East in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Puttalam, in the District of Puttalam, in the Province of North Western, referred to in Notice No. 41/0214 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2114/31 of 14th March, 2019 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. M. H. PRIYADHARSHANI, Commissioner General of Title Settlement Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 29th October, 2019.\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 31661 - 14 (2019/12)\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2154 / 15 \u2013 2019 \u0dd9\u0daf\u0dc3\u0dd0\u0014\u0db6\u0016 18 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0019 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf\u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf\u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2019.12.18\n\nNo. 2154 / 15 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 18, 2019\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a \u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0d