    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO PROPERTY OF INTESTATE REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT NO. 21 OF 1998 (SECTION 55) Reference the intestate property of late Mrs. Pushpalatha Warnakulasuriya who resided in the village of Siddamulla, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Homagama, in the District of Colombo. It is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or interest in the intestate property of the late Mrs. Pushpalatha Warnakulas-uriya described in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 30th December, 2019 stating his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, exparte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998. P. M. H. PRIYADHARSHANI, Commissioner General of Title Settlement Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Madura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 22nd November, 2019\n\nN.B. \u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk.\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2154/28 - 2019 \u0dd9\u0daf\u0dc3\u0dd0\u0016\u0db6\u0018 19 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u001a \u001b\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u0002 \u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.12.19\n\nNo. 2154/28 \u2013 THURSDAY, DECEMBER 19, 2019\n\n1 A - G 31671 - 14 ( 2019 / 12 )\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u001a\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d85 \u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba - 2019.12.19 PART III \u2013 GAZE