    "chunk_text": "04.Mr. P. K. Jayalath, Officer in Special Grade of Sri Lanka Administrative Service as the Secretary of theMinistry of Provincial Lands, Irrigation, Highways, Rural Development, House and Women Affairs of NorthCentral Provincial Council with effect from 17.05.2019 untill 31.08.2019 on contract basis.\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'20PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 20.12.20192A\n\n05.Mrs. Thejani Thilakerathne, Officer in Special Grade of Sri Lanka Administrative Service as the SecretaryProvincial Public Service Commission of the North Central Province with effect from 11.06.2019 to11.09.2019.\n\n06.Mr. A. K. N. Wickramasinghe, Officer in Special Grade of Sri Lanka Administrative Service as the Secretaryof the Governor of North Central Province with effect from 01.09.2019.\n\n07.Mr. E. M. P. Ekanayake, Officer in Special Grade of Sri Lanka Administrative Service as the Secretary of theMinistry of Provincial Lands, Irrigation, Highways, Rural Development, House and Women Affairs of NorthCentral Provincial Council with effect from 01.09.2019.\n\n08.Mr. E. W. N. A. Egodawela, Officer in Special Grade of Sri Lanka Administrative Service as the SecretaryPublic Service Commission of North Central Province with effect from 12.09.2019 to 22.10.2019.\n\n09.Mr. R. M. R. Rathnayake, Officer in Special Grade of Sri Lanka Administrative Service as the Secretary of theProvincial Public Service Commission of North Central Province with effect from 23.10.2019.\n\n10.Mr. E. W. N. A. Egodawela , Officer in Special Grade of Sri Lanka Administrative Service as the Secretary ofthe Ministry of Agriculture, Agro Production Marketing, Animal Production and Fisheries with effect from23.10.2019.\n\n11.Mr. S. K. Somarathne, Officer in Grade III of Sri Lanka Administrative Service for acting as the Director ofSports of North Central Province with effect from 01.02.2019."
