    "chunk_size_bytes": 2058,
    "chunk_text": "Boundaries of the Land : North: Lot No. 4 and Pettigala Estate claimed by Land Reform Commission; East: Pettigala Estate claimed by Land Reform Commission and Lot Nos. 3 and 4; South: Lots 3, 4 and 1; West: Lot No. 01\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 31698 - 27 (2019/12)\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.21 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 21.12.2019\n\n03. Lot No. 3 Name of the land: Lemaswaththa (Pettigala Division); Description: Waste Land; Claimant : Land Reform Commission; Extent: 0.0071 Hectare.\n\nBoundaries of the Land : North: Lot No. 02, Pettigala Watta and Road (Pradeshiya Saba) claimed by Land Reforms Commission; East: Pettigala Estate claimed by Land Reforms Commission, Road (Pradeshiya Saba) and Lot No. 04; South : Road (Divisional Secretariat Councils) Lots 4 and 2; West: Lot 2\n\n04. Lot No. 4 Name of the land: Lemaswaththa (Pettigala Division); Description: Waste Land; Claimant: Land Reforms Commission; Extent: 0.0311 Hectare.\n\nBoundaries of the Land : North: Lots No. 1, 2, 3 and Road (Pradeshiya Saba); East: Road (Pradeshiya Saba) and Road (Road Development Authority); South: Road (Road Development Authority) and Kandura; West: Kandura, Lot Nos. 1, 2 and 3.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Haldummulla on the 10th February, 2020 at 10.00 a.m., and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 03rd day of February, 2020, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nV. P. SUNETH JINENDRASENA, Divisional Secretary, Haldummulla."
