    "chunk_text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Haldummulla on the 10th February, 2020 at 10.00 a.m., and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 03rd day of February, 2020, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nV. P. SUNETH JINENDRASENA, Divisional Secretary, Haldummulla.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 07\n\nMy Reference No.: BD/WM/LND/2/5/AQUIS/16.\n\nLand Ministry Ref. No. : 4-3/9/2016/WS/45.\n\nI, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 07 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, The Government intends to acquire the following land which are for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land to be Acquired:\n\nIn the Province of Uva, District of Badulla, Divisional Secretariat of Welimada in the Minor Division of Dambawini Palatha Korale, Village of Guruthalawa, Surveyor General F. V. P. 189, Paper No. 30 of supplement 20 and dated on 24.08.2018 base plot Lot number 621 the total extent of 0.0324 hectare the details follow :\n\n1. Lot No. 621 Name of the Land : Gonagolla; Description : Home Garden, Water Tank and Permanent building; Claimant : The Government and S. Badurdeen, holding permit No. 189/252; Extent : 0.0324 Hectare."
